Sztokholmskie keszowanie na luzie, zgodnie ze szwedzką tradycją "fika" 🙂 Luz, zero pośpiechu, przyjemność na całego. Posiedzieliśmy tu chwilę przez odprawą warty. Pzdr, Wojtek</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1161856765"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="24157615">mikkokalevi</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">I visited the obelisk and posted the answers through the message center. here's another picture as proof of visiting the place</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log></groundspeak:logs></groundspeak:cache></wpt><wpt lat="59.322667" lon="18.073333"><time>2018-02-19T00:00:00</time><name>GC7B78D</name><desc>Meet some Swedish celebrities! by 6wyn</desc><url>https://www.geocaching.com/geocache/GC7B78D</url><urlname>Meet some Swedish celebrities!</urlname><sym>Geocache Found</sym><type>Geocache|Virtual Cache</type><groundspeak:cache id="6388216" available="true" archived="false"><groundspeak:name>Meet some Swedish celebrities!</groundspeak:name><groundspeak:placed_by>6wyn</groundspeak:placed_by><groundspeak:owner id="1715426">6wyn</groundspeak:owner><groundspeak:type>Virtual Cache</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container><groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:attribute id="24" inc="1">Wheelchair accessible</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="6" inc="1">Recommended for kids</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="41" inc="1">Stroller accessible</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="1" inc="1">Dogs</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="13" inc="1">Available 24/7</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="25" inc="0">Parking nearby</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="55" inc="1">Short hike (&lt;1 km)</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="59" inc="1">Food nearby</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="26" inc="1">Public transportation nearby</groundspeak:attribute></groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:difficulty>1.5</groundspeak:difficulty><groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain><groundspeak:country>Sweden</groundspeak:country><groundspeak:state>Stockholm</groundspeak:state><groundspeak:short_description>
</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>&lt;h2&gt;SWE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;Stockholm är en stad som är fylld med konst och konstverk, med allt ifrån små bronsbystar och väggmålningar till enorma statyer av forna dagars kungar och drottningar. Den här cachen fokuserar på de många statyer som finns av forna kändisar inom kultur och vetenskap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;center&gt;&lt;img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Jarntorget_Taube_mars_2007.JPG" height="600" width="480" /&gt;&lt;/center&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;För att få logga den här cachen, behöver du besöka åtminstone 2 olika statyer av svenska kultur- eller vetenskapscelebriteter, enligt punktlistan nedan. Besöken behöver inte göras på samma dag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evert Taube vid startkoordinaterna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En annan, valfri, staty på en kulturell eller vetenskaplig celebritet, utifrån listan med waypoints nedan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;För att visa att du varit på platsen så måste du ta ett foto på dig själv och/eller din GPS vid varje staty. Inkludera även namnet på de statyer som du har besökt i din logg. Vänligen skicka inga foton i privat meddelande till mig, bara foton i loggen accepteras. &lt;b&gt;Loggar som inte fullföljer dessa villkor kommer att raderas utan föregående varning.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Om du hittar en staty som inte är inkluderad i waypointsen nedan så är du givetvis välkommen att logga med den, under förutsättning att nedanstående regler uppfylls:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statyn finns innanför Stockholms tullar (är du osäker så kan du använda vägtullarna som referens)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Endast kändisar inom kultur eller vetenskap godkänns (uppfinnare, författare, skådespelare, musiker, kemister etc), inga kungar/drottningar, politiker eller fantasifigurer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statyn måste visa personens hela kropp, dvs byster, etsningar, tavlor och liknande är inte ok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ENG&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;Stockholm is a city which is filled with art, ranging from small bronze busts to enormous statues of kings and queens from the past. This cache however focus on the many statues of cultural celebrities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;In order to log this cache as found, your task is to visit at least 2 differences statues of Swedish cultural celebrities according to the conditions given below. You dont necessarily have to visit both of them at the same day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evert Taube at the given coordinates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Another statue of a cultural or science celebrity of your own choice, according to the provides list of waypoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;Take a photo of you and/or your GPS at each location to prove that you've been there, and include the name of the statues that you've visited in your log. Please do not send any images to me by message, only images in the log is accepted. &lt;b&gt;Logs that doesn't fullfill these requirements will be removed without warning.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
If you find some statue that aren't included in the waypoints you are more than welcome to include that one in your log, as long as the following rules are fulfilled:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The statue must be located within the tollgates (if you are unsure of the limits, us the road tolls as reference)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only cultural or science celebrities (actors, authors, musicians, inventors etc.), no kings/queens, politicians or fantasy figures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The statue must show the whole body; busts, etchings, paintings etc. is not ok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Virtual Reward - 2017/2018&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style="font-family:Garamond;font-size:130%;text-align:left;"&gt;This Virtual Cache is part of a limited release of Virtuals created between August 24, 2017 and August 24, 2018. Only 4,000 cache owners were given the opportunity to hide a Virtual Cache. Learn more about Virtual Rewards on the &lt;a href="https://www.geocaching.com/blog/2017/08/virtual-rewards/"&gt;Geocaching Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

</groundspeak:long_description><groundspeak:encoded_hints /><groundspeak:logs><groundspeak:log id="1382285000"><groundspeak:date>2026-09-02T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="47809071">GoldFuchs1</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Thank you for the cache. Greetings from Germany.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1382282127"><groundspeak:date>2026-09-01T20:01:33</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="1557211">TZ Toy</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Henny Penny and I chose the two closest to our place (Evert Tavbe and Olaus Petri). However we anticipate seeing more as we explore outside of Gamla Stan. TFTH </groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1382174007"><groundspeak:date>2026-09-01T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="6704036">brisen60</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">An unserem zweiten Tag in Schweden sind DeLaTrick und wir in Stockholm angekommen.
Heute ging es kreuz und quer durch die ganze City. Unterwegs haben wir viele Dosen und virtuelle Caches gefunden.

Vielen Dank an **6wyn** fürs Legen und Pflegen.

**Besten Gruß - brisen60**</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1382060297"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-31T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="2034679">Aljonis</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Aljonis with Nicodemus Tessin the Elder😁👍.
♥️lichen Dank fürs Herlocken an 6wyn
Sonnige Grüße Aljonis 🍀</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1381656032"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-30T10:44:47</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="19949769">Nettanelo</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Tack för en trevlig vandring, trots att det regnade lite. Hittade bla Taube 👻. </groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1161509410"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="24157615">mikkokalevi</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">En dagsvandring i Stockholm, med syfte att få olika typer av upptäckter, detta var en av dem. tack för geocache.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log></groundspeak:logs></groundspeak:cache></wpt><wpt lat="59.3251" lon="18.070817"><time>2023-04-22T12:00:00</time><name>GCA6W15</name><desc>ällös ohi kävele (don't walk by) by mikkokalevi</desc><url>https://www.geocaching.com/geocache/GCA6W15</url><urlname>ällös ohi kävele (don't walk by)</urlname><sym>Geocache Found</sym><type>Geocache|Event Cache</type><groundspeak:cache id="9028819" available="false" archived="true"><groundspeak:name>ällös ohi kävele (don't walk by)</groundspeak:name><groundspeak:placed_by>mikkokalevi</groundspeak:placed_by><groundspeak:owner id="24157615">mikkokalevi</groundspeak:owner><groundspeak:type>Event Cache</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:container>Other</groundspeak:container><groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:attribute id="24" inc="1">Wheelchair accessible</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="6" inc="1">Recommended for kids</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="41" inc="1">Stroller accessible</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="1" inc="1">Dogs</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="8" inc="1">Scenic view</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="7" inc="1">Takes less than one hour</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="59" inc="1">Food nearby</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="27" inc="1">Drinking water nearby</groundspeak:attribute></groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty><groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain><groundspeak:country>Sweden</groundspeak:country><groundspeak:state>Stockholm</groundspeak:state><groundspeak:short_description>&lt;b&gt;22 April 2023, 12:00 - 12:30&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>&lt;p&gt;Don&amp;#39;t walk by. Welcome to chat about geocaching and more in either Finnish or English.&lt;/p&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description><groundspeak:encoded_hints /><groundspeak:logs><groundspeak:log id="1169087026"><groundspeak:date>2023-05-23T09:00:13</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Archived</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="617010">Geocaching HQ Admin</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Thank you for hosting this geocaching Event! The date of the Event has passed. We automatically archive Events after 30 days (60 days for Mega- and Giga-Events). Attendees can still log archived Events, log trackables, and share their experiences.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1164873240"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:27:05</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Unknown</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="16179844">6ten</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">A nice little meeting on this pretty warm day, with surprisingly many tourists around. Hope you had a nice stay here!

**Thank you for the event!** [:D]</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1162363594"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Unknown</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="3680651">Bernike</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">It was a very short visit from me, I came here on my break and I had to hurry back to work. Nice seeing you, hope you had a nice stay! Kiitos for the event! 😊

Loggen signerades med blå penna. Varför denna info? Ifall remsan blir blöt och texten suddas en aning, så hittar man sin logg lättare 😉

På loggandets dag hade cachen följande egenskaper:

D 1.0 
T 1.0 
Other 
Event Cache</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1162120130"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Unknown</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="9022508">Micke70</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Tfte !!! Besökte eventet.

Snabbt hittad och loggad.

Tack för burken !!!

Blev först en tur in till Gamla stan. Sen åkte jag och rogernordin ut mot Gustavsberg och loggade lite burkar.

Den här var en av dom burkar som jag loggade idag.

😀😀 😀😀 😀😀 😀😀 😀😀

Alltid finns det något som man behöver logga. En dagens burk ... en dagens LAB ... ett dagens event ... en dagens tradd ... en dagens myst ... en dagens multi ... en dagens letterbox ... en dagens WIG ... en dagens other ... en dagens micro ... en dagens small ... en dagens regular ... en dagens large ... en dagens fyrkantig ... en dagens rund ... en dagens T5a ... och så vidare. Listan kan ju göras hur lång som helst. Behövs ju bara en anledning för att logga en burk eller två...

Cachiiing !!</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1162011167"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Unknown</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="12931897">mikano66</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Idag hade jag och L8 bestämt oss för att vara med på det här eventet. Men innan det så träffade rogernordin för att fixa några saker. När sen eventet startade så var vi på plats och efter ett tag så hittade vi även EO en bit från där vi stod. Idag var det förvånansvärt få på plats men det var mycket trevligt ändå och man hann med en hel del geopladder.

Stort tack mikkokalevi för det här eventet!</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1161447509"><groundspeak:date>2023-04-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Unknown</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="24157615">mikkokalevi</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">En dagsvandring i Stockholm, med syfte att få olika typer av upptäckter, detta var en av dem.  tack till geocacherna som besökte träffen.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log></groundspeak:logs></groundspeak:cache></wpt><wpt lat="59.3159" lon="18.07955"><time>2010-02-06T00:00:00</time><name>GC23JTP</name><desc>Katarina kyrka by Möjagumman</desc><url>https://www.geocaching.com/geocache/GC23JTP</url><urlname>Katarina kyrka</urlname><sym>Geocache Found</sym><type>Geocache|Multi-cache</type><groundspeak:cache id="1543390" available="false" archived="true"><groundspeak:name>Katarina kyrka</groundspeak:name><groundspeak:placed_by>Möjagumman</groundspeak:placed_by><groundspeak:owner id="2378037">Möjagumman</groundspeak:owner><groundspeak:type>Multi-cache</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:container>Small</groundspeak:container><groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:attribute id="42" inc="1">Needs maintenance</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="41" inc="1">Stroller accessible</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="13" inc="1">Available 24/7</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="7" inc="1">Takes less than one hour</groundspeak:attribute><groundspeak:attribute id="15" inc="1">Available in winter</groundspeak:attribute></groundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty><groundspeak:terrain>1.5</groundspeak:terrain><groundspeak:country>Sweden</groundspeak:country><groundspeak:state>Stockholm</groundspeak:state><groundspeak:short_description>En tvåstegs multi vid Katarina kyrka. Kyrkan och platsen har en
lång och dramatisk historia. A two step multi by the Katarina
Church. The Church and the place have a long and dramatic history.</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>&lt;div class="WordSection1"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style=
'mso-ansi-language:EN-US' xml:lang="EN-US"&gt;The co-ordinates lead
you to the western gate into the church yard at &lt;span class=
"SpellE"&gt;Högbergsgatan&lt;/span&gt;. To the right of the gate there is an
electrical cabinet with a four digit sign = ABCD. To find the
cache&lt;span class="GramE"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'&gt;reduce&lt;/b&gt; the north
co-ordinate with &lt;b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'&gt;(DC -
10)&lt;/b&gt; and&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'&gt;increase&lt;/b&gt; the east
co-ordinate with &lt;b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'&gt;(AB +
50).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;b style=
'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style=
'mso-ansi-language:EN-US' xml:lang="EN-US"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section1"&gt;
