roundspeak:attributes><groundspeak:difficulty>2</groundspeak:difficulty><groundspeak:terrain>2.5</groundspeak:terrain><groundspeak:country>Sweden</groundspeak:country><groundspeak:state>Stockholm</groundspeak:state><groundspeak:short_description>A walk in the "old town" of Stockholm.
</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>This is a very easy Wherigo. I made this Wherigo a long time ago, but it was not a geocache. Now I also added a box for all the geocachers.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
This Wherigo is made for tourist! So I made it so easy as possible.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Starting Location&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Take the subway to "Gamla stan". Go out on "Malartorget".&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="http://www.wherigo.com/cartridge/details.aspx?CGUID=2328a347-72ce-4915-92f7-aa0c26afb3d3" target="_blank"&gt;Click here to download the Wherigo&lt;/a&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description><groundspeak:encoded_hints>Magnetic on electric "box". </groundspeak:encoded_hints><groundspeak:logs><groundspeak:log id="1381837084"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-30T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="5458274">FionaCH</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">A lovely place to explore today, and a few caches picked up, including this one. A neat hide here, thank you.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1381320853"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-28T16:58:10</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="5660998">janjorjack</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Jtee and I are off on a grand adventure.  This time we are off to Sweden and the Aland Islands. It’s a new location for me so I am enjoying the sites and meeting new people too. Thanks for the smile.</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1381320815"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-28T16:58:01</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="164089">jtee</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">nice to get a wherigo in Stockholm.. thks for the fun </groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1380351330"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-23T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="3925923">razhthak</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Nice walk through gamla stan during my trip to Stockholm. TFTC</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1380200368"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-22T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="5223777">YamaGypsy</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">On a wonderful adventure with Waawhoo and TheBrecks for 3 weeks in a campervan. Today we got to explore Gamla Stan.  Tftc!</groundspeak:text></ground