Mer om honom kan ni läsa om på plats</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>En medelstor plåtburk med penna, loggbok och förhoppningsvis TB;s.</groundspeak:long_description><groundspeak:encoded_hints>Under</groundspeak:encoded_hints><groundspeak:logs><groundspeak:log id="1381501158"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-29T16:26:24</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="26060369">Aunelmi79</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Suomi-Ruotsi-Nirja-Suomi-Ruotsi-Suomi -turneella</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1382017406"><groundspeak:date>2026-08-29T12:00:00</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="8817211">huhhai</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Aunelmi79:n kanssa Norjaa ristiin rastiin kolmisen päivää ja nyt Suomessa.
